slug: "setup-and-permissions"
title: "Setup and Permissions"
category: "setup"
excerpt: "Invite Niko with the current Discord OAuth flow, grant only the permissions your enabled features need, and verify role hierarchy before configuring the bot."
tags: ["invite", "permissions", "setup", "security"]
